{"id":47,"date":"2019-12-08T18:47:30","date_gmt":"2019-12-08T09:47:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dnslab.korea.ac.kr\/?p=47"},"modified":"2022-08-06T14:20:46","modified_gmt":"2022-08-06T05:20:46","slug":"professor","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/dnslab-inha.github.io/dnslab.korea.ac.kr\/professor\/","title":{"rendered":"Professor"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Heejun Roh, Ph.D.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Basic Information<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Korean Name: \ub178\ud76c\uc900 (Chinese Characters: \uf933\u7199\u4fca)<\/li><li>E-mail: hjroh _at_ korea _dot_ ac _dot_ kr<\/li><li>Office: Room 207, Science and Technology Building II, Korea University Sejong Campus, 2511 Sejong-ro, Sejong Special Autonomous City, Republic of Korea<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/scholar.google.com\/citations?user=AjUYnyIAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\">Google Scholar<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-6432-3234\">ORCID<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/dblp.org\/pers\/hd\/r\/Roh:Heejun\">DBLP<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.genealogy.math.ndsu.nodak.edu\/id.php?id=212887\">Academic Genealogy<\/a><\/li><li>For the latest information, please visit <a href=\"https:\/\/netlab.korea.ac.kr\/hjroh\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/netlab.korea.ac.kr\/hjroh\/\">the CV page in NetLab<\/a>.<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Academic Backgrounds<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Ph.D. in Computer Science and Engineering, Graduate School, Korea University, Seoul, Republic of Korea (Mar. 2011 &#8211; Feb. 2017)<ul><li>Dissertation Title: Design and Optimization of Intermittently Networked Systems<\/li><li>Overall GPA: 4.07\/4.50<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>M.E. in Computer Science and Engineering, Graduate School, Korea University, Seoul, Republic of Korea (Mar. 2009 &#8211; Feb. 2011)<ul><li>Dissertation Title: Delay Minimization Schemes of Tree-based Neighbor Discovery in Mobile Robot Networks<\/li><li>Overall GPA: 4.22\/4.50<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>B.S. (Hons.) in Computer Science and Engineering, College of Information and Communications, Korea University, Seoul, Republic of Korea (Mar. 2005 &#8211; Feb. 2009)<ul><li>Overall GPA: 3.90\/4.50; Note: His B.S. is called &#8220;\uacf5\ud559\ud559\uc0ac&#8221; (B.E.) in Korean<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>B.S. in Mathematics (Double Major), College of Science, Korea University, Seoul, Republic of Korea (Mar. 2005 &#8211; Feb. 2009)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Positions Held<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Department Chair\/Assistant Professor, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/aisecu.korea.ac.kr\" target=\"_blank\">Department of Artificial Intelligence (AI) Cyber Security<\/a>, College of Science &amp; Technology, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/sejong.korea.ac.kr\" target=\"_blank\">Korea University Sejong Campus<\/a>, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.sejong.go.kr\/eng.do\" target=\"_blank\">Sejong City<\/a>, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.korea.net\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.korea.net\" target=\"_blank\">Republic of Korea<\/a> (March 2019 &#8211; present)<ul><li>The department is previously known as <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/secu.korea.ac.kr\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/secu.korea.ac.kr\/\" target=\"_blank\">Cyber Security Major<\/a>, Division of Applied Mathematical Sciences<\/li><li>Also affiliated with Defensible Networked Systems Lab. (DNSLab), Department of Cyber Security, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/graduate.korea.ac.kr\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/graduate.korea.ac.kr\" target=\"_blank\">Graduate School<\/a>, Korea University as the Lab Director<\/li><\/ul><ul><li>Also affiliated with <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/netlab.korea.ac.kr\" target=\"_blank\">Network and Security Research Lab. (NetLab)<\/a>, School of Cybersecurity, Korea University, Seoul, Republic of Korea<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>Research Professor, <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/fnc.korea.ac.kr\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/fnc.korea.ac.kr\/\" target=\"_blank\">Future Network Center<\/a>, Korea University, Seoul, Republic of Korea (March 2017 &#8211; February 2019)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Research Interests<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Security and Privacy in Wirelsss and Mobile Networks<\/li><li>RF-powered Computing and Networking<\/li><li>Resource Allocation and Architectural Design in Cloud Data Centers<\/li><li>Economic Issues in Computer Networks<\/li><li>Cooperative Networking and Cognitive Radio Networks<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Honors &amp; Awards<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><strong>Postdoctoral Fellowship Grant, National Research Foundation of Korea, 2017-2018.<\/strong><ul><li>Project Title: Design of Amorphous Network-based Intermittent Fog Networking Systems<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li><strong>The 1st Place Transactions Award of 2018 Annual IEEE Consumer Electronics Society Chester W. Sall Memorial Awards, January 2018.<\/strong><\/li><li>Outstanding Paper Award, Dept. of Computer and Radio Communications Engineering, Graduate School, Korea University, February 2017.<\/li><li><strong>Qualcomm Innovation Award at Korea University, June 2016.<\/strong><\/li><li>The 8th Student of the Year (SOTY) Award, Network Research Lab., Korea University, January 2017.<\/li><li>The 7th Student of the Year (SOTY) Award, Network Research Lab., Korea University, May 2016.<\/li><li>The 6th Student of the Year (SOTY) Award, Network Research Lab., Korea University, January 2015.<\/li><li>The 4th Student of the Year (SOTY) Award, Network Research Lab., Korea University, February 2013.<\/li><li>The 3rd Student of the Yea